All root Go runtime sources and upstream tests are included, without a nested
module or third-party runtime dependencies. The optional SST runner retains
its upstream exclusions and requires an external corpus supplied by -sstpath.

Local change: Config.AllowUnalignedData and NewWithConfig provide optional
unaligned word/long data access for SNDH replay compatibility. New retains
strict MC68000 alignment checks; odd instruction addresses remain invalid in
both modes. Reset and SetState preserve the configured compatibility mode.
